---
// Los 7 Minerales Especiales & Mineralogía de Alto Volumen en Las Arenas del Santa
---

<section id="especiales" class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-12 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200 gap-4">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase font-extrabold tracking-widest text-amber-600 block mb-1">
          Asociación Mineralógica Principal
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
          Los 7 Minerales Especiales de la Mina
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 max-w-md">
        Identificados en estudios petrográficos independientes (Dr. J. Injoque / INGEMMET / MRC1). Constituyen subproductos de alta rentabilidad comercial en arenas de placer.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Complementary Cards (Summed to Oro and Magnetita) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Mineral 1: Monacita (Tierras Raras) - Featured Card -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 via-white to-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-amber-400 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-800 border border-amber-500/30">
                Vector Geopolítico Maestro
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950 mt-2 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Monacita (TTRR)</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
              0.2% – 2.0%
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">Importancia:</strong> La mena mineralógica más valiosa para extraer tierras raras ligeras y pesadas (Neodimio, Terbio, Disprosio), insumos críticos para imanes de vehículos eléctricos y defensa.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/80 mb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider block">Cotización Concentrado (TREO ~60%)</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-black text-amber-700 font-mono">$6,300 – $6,500 USD / ton</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-amber-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span>Alta conc. en Guadalupito</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-amber-800">Mena Crítica</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mineral 2: Ilmenita -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-slate-400 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-800 border border-blue-200">
                Titanio Estratégico
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950 mt-2 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Ilmenita (FeTiO₃)</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-blue-200">
              Hasta 25%
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Importancia:</strong> Principal mena de titanio del planeta, vital para la aviación militar y comercial, recubrimientos térmicos y prótesis de tecnología médica.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 mb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider block">Cotización Concentrado (50% TiO₂)</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 font-mono">$280 – $380 USD / ton</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block mt-0.5">Esponja Ti defensa: $6,500 – $7,000 / ton</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span>Arenas negras 0.2–1.0 A</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-blue-700">Aviación & Defensa</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mineral 3: Andalucita -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-slate-400 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-orange-50 text-orange-800 border border-orange-200">
                Refractarios Térmicos
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950 mt-2 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Andalucita</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-orange-600 bg-orange-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-orange-200">
              40% – 72%
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Importancia:</strong> Refractario estratégico de ultra-alto rendimiento térmico para recubrir hornos siderúrgicos y cementeros de alta eficiencia energética.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 mb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider block">Cotización Promedio Mercado</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 font-mono">$450 – $580 USD / ton</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block mt-0.5">Demanda al alza en mercados de la OCDE</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span>Fracción gruesa (+3.0 A)</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-orange-700">Hornos Siderúrgicos</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mineral 4: Circones -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-slate-400 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-50 text-purple-800 border border-purple-200">
                Zirconio & Nuclear
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950 mt-2 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Circones (ZrSiO₄)</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-purple-200">
              0.5% – 2.0%
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Importancia:</strong> Clave para cerámica técnica, fundición de precisión y fuentes primarias de zirconio y hafnio para reactores nucleares y semiconductores.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 mb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider block">Cotización Estándar a Premium</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 font-mono">$1,800 – $2,300 USD / ton</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block mt-0.5">Subproducto constante de alto margen</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span>Asociado a monacita</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-purple-700">Reactores & Chips</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mineral 5: Hematita -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-slate-400 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 border border-slate-300">
                Hierro & Densidad
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950 mt-2 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Hematita (Fe₂O₃)</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-700 bg-slate-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
              Hasta 33%
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Importancia:</strong> Piedra angular de la producción global de hierro y pigmentos industriales pesados para blindajes y recubrimientos densos.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 mb-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400 tracking-wider block">Cotización Internacional Fe 62%</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 font-mono">$90 – $115 USD / ton</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 block mt-0.5">Complemento masivo a la magnetita</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span>Desembocadura río Santa</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Fracción Magnética 0.7 A</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
